    <Cell ss:StyleID="s67"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Inspect Title column in NPD_ApproversComments.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s67"><Data ss:Type="String">Title column is empty string (''). Title is not populated with brand or request ID.</Data></Cell>
