    <Cell ss:StyleID="s67"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Enter 'Please revise item quantity'. 2. Submit.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s67"><Data ss:Type="String">Request Status becomes Rework. Row added to NPD_ApproversComments with ActionVia='Mail', Action='Rework', Comments.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s67"><Data ss:Type="String">ActionVia = Mail</Data></Cell>
